{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000040:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a1653213dc7632ba1f31cbe80d93bc\",\"output\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"Leonxlnx taste-skill design-taste-frontend SKILL.md dials variance motion density\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://opentrend.org/project/taste-skill\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Taste Skill AI Skills Open Source Project\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This feature enables developers to customize the visual style of their web pages directly inside the configuration file by adjusting numerical dials from 1 to 10. ... These dials include DESIGN_VARIANCE (layout experimentation), MOTION_INTENSITY (animation depth), and VISUAL_DENSITY (information per viewport). When the AI agent parses these parameters, it maps the qualitative numbers to quantitative CSS design tokens rather than simple variables\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.skills.sh/leonxlnx/taste-skill/gpt-taste\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"gpt-taste — leonxlnx/taste-skill\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"- **Description:** Classic skill for GPT and Codex, opt-in: it runs only when called by name. ... Layout variance, a strict AIDA page structure and GSAP scroll motion.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://python.plainenglish.io/10-claude-code-and-codex-skills-most-developers-havent-tried-4e6916b26f49?gi=b3a6537e4ff6\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"10 Claude Code and Codex Skills Most Developers Haven’t Tried\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Taste Skill\\\\n**GitHub:** Leonxlnx/taste-skill\\\\nEver asked an AI to build a landing page and received the same purple gradient, rounded cards, and generic layout you’ve seen a hundred times?\\\\nTaste Skill aims to fix that. It guides coding agents through art direction, typography, spacing, color, imagery, and motion.\\\",\\\"page_last_modifie