tle\\\":\\\"Stop the Slop with Taste Skill for Better AI Design\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"website interfaces with better ai design. ... Developed by designer Leon Lin, the open-source toolkit brings disciplined ai design to modern environments. ... It integrates with Cursor and Claude Code. Instead of letting LLMs default to generic layouts, the framework provides structured SKILL.md instructions.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1783382400},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://a…","truncated":true}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000041:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a1653214727289b82bfc6644cacb46\",\"output\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"impeccable\\\\\\\" design skill Claude SKILL.md install single skill vs taste\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://dev.to/skillgild/impeccable-vs-taste-skill-which-claude-design-skill-to-use-tested-3d6i\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Impeccable vs Taste Skill: which Claude design skill to use, tested\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"**Short answer:** pick **Taste Skill** for a clean landing page at a modest cost, and **Impeccable** when the page has to be memorable, has to stay truthful about your product, or is an app or dashboard rather than a marketing page. In our test on the same brief, Taste Skill produced a calm, tidy page for $2.28 in 7 minutes; Impeccable produced a far bolder page, and the only one that invented no product facts, for $7.49 in 24 minutes.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1791849600},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://web-hobbies.com/en/claude/best-ui-skills-for-claude/\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Best UI Skills for Claude: 6 I Tested on a Real Screen\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"**Tip:** install one skill, not the whole pack: `npx skills add https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill --skill design-taste-frontend`.\\\\ntaste-skill on GitHub ... 4. impeccable: best polish toolkit for Claude Code\\\\n**What it does:** one skill with 24 commands, run as `/impeccable polish`, `/impeccable audit`, `/impeccable critique`, `bolder`, `quieter` and more. It also ships 59 rule-based detectors that flag common AI design mistakes without an API key.\\\\n**In my test:** reviewed. It overlaps with\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792195200},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://dev.to/skillgild/claude-code-frontend-design-skills-taste-skill-and-logo-design-295b\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"T