n, the way you would talk to a designer who already gets your taste.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://deonna.substack.com/p/your-website-is-giving-claude-made\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Your Website Is Giving \\\\\\\"Claude Made This.\\\\\\\" Here's the Free Fix.\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Both are Impeccable's own example pages.\\\\n**The model has taste. ... Impeccable is a design skill for coding agents, made by Paul…","truncated":true}
